<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Lugal-kinishe-dudu</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 24th century BCE</span> · <a href="/centuries/24th-century-bce">24th century BCE</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Lugal-kinishe-dudu was a king of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uruk">Uruk</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/early-dynastic-period">Early Dynastic period</a>, around the twenty-fourth century BCE, who also ruled <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ur">Ur</a> and claimed kingship over both cities. Inscriptions of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/enmetena">Enmetena</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lagash">Lagash</a> record a pact of brotherhood with him, one of the earliest known diplomatic agreements in history.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/lugal-kinishe-dudu.jpg" alt="Lugal-kinishe-dudu" width="320" height="213" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown artist · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Foundation_nail_Entemena_Louvre_AO22934.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
